  "problem": "Find $\\,|\\begin{aligned}v & w & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 5\\end{aligned}|$ given that $\\,|\\begin{aligned}v & w \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{aligned}|=3.$",
